# Create User
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@doe.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###
# Generate Token
POST http://localhost:8080/users/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@doe.com",
  "password": "123456"
}